    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk6-prepositions-p03-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "因 + cause",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "因 introduces a cause in compact formal language. A cause explains a result rather than stating an intended goal.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我们因下雨取消会议。",
                "pinyin": "wǒmen yīn xiàyǔ qǔxiāo huìyì 。",
                "meaning": "We are canceling the meeting because it is raining.",
                "audio": "a04277c1374abb5fc9b25cb60981585a457855d6dbc5a382f6d44840af471fcf"
              },
              {
                "text": "他因病没来。",
                "pinyin": "tā yīn bìng méi lái 。",
                "meaning": "He did not come because of illness.",
                "audio": "0cabba3e962eefb257f11d94f0668a8070a928cff1e24eb93f408aaeec3bac9b"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "因",
                "pinyin": "yīn",
                "meaning": "because of; owing to; because",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "a168eb0996d92cdad116b5ef2c5c769f5b0b711907ac253e1a76b2cb028a37d5"
              }
            ]
